          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "From +5V, a second diode D2 (PMEG3030EP...) feeds a dedicated servo power rail backed by four 100 µF capacitors",
          "sheet and page": "Design specification, §4 Power"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The servo supply is shorted to ground, so the servo headers will not receive the intended supply voltage. With external or M5Stack 5V present, the short can also cause excessive current through D3 and the supply path.",
